  <title>Functions and Function Notation</title>
  <metadata>
    <md:content-id>m49301</md:content-id>
    <md:title>Functions and Function Notation</md:title>
    <md:abstract>
      <para id="para-00001">In this section, you will:</para>
      <list id="list-00001">
        <item>Determine whether a relation represents a function.</item>
        <item>Find the value of a function.</item>
        <item>Determine whether a function is one-to-one.</item>
        <item>Use the vertical line test to identify functions.</item>
        <item>Graph the functions listed in the library of functions.</item>
      </list>
